    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "Under 0.021 inches - +0.003/-0.006" (at 220.2 150.26) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 772e954d-ff8d-4ff3-bf70-0715b56a5ce6)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "14.  Traces shall finish at the artwork width, +/- 1 mil." (at 212.5165 164.2935) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 83906ee9-7b8d-46df-97c4-d2f080f0696b)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "There shall be no soldermask on any land." (at 220.24 36.935) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 94ac96ff-9abc-4537-911c-89f666e6773b)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "A.  All thieving pads are kept at least 55 mils from other features," (at 219.144432 83.015019) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 990f2399-58e7-46fc-b2b8-062a2c1e966c)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "Soldermask shall be in accordance with IPC-SM-840 Class T." (at 220.24 32.49) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp 9bb09d7e-6d34-4fa7-8454-5829e8d6c59f)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "3.  Silkscreen:  DO NOT clear silkscreen (legend) from tented vias." (at 213.12 41.525) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp a1350469-9b3e-4417-b117-b78a3686e3ad)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "10.  Ref.: Minimum Conductor Width/Spacing:  6mil/5.9mil." (at 212.58 126.384) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp b90f5e1b-e143-49fd-a32b-f7aeba1fc1b8)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "5.  Minimum copper plate in all holes to be 0.001 inches." (at 214.63 65.86) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp c41697e2-d12c-46cd-90dc-bb244edb9a49)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "2.  Soldermask:  Soldermask over bare copper, *GREEN* both sides." (at 213.82204 28.228521) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp c7136b0e-714f-409e-9caa-abf8630d923c)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "Over 0.090 inches - +/-0.006" (at 220.2 157.88) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp e65e1a72-e35b-430f-a4c8-956d1ab4057d)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "6.  Copper thieving may be added by the PCB fabricator on inner and outer signal layers to assist" (at 213.76 72.58) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp eb087dba-95c2-40e6-a8bd-3f2749bd9f8a)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "the plating process ONLY IF:" (at 219.144432 77.300019) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp f1f75175-8b86-45a1-93c8-7c5d38571b5c)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "Top side with white, permanent, non-conductive ink." (at 219.47 45.97) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp f3249f9e-1b67-4a3f-a7f2-afbe1ddf5a36)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "1.  Base Material 370HR, RoHS compliant and compatible." (at 213.418568 22.476981) (layer "Dwgs.User") (tstamp f4867ebb-0171-4016-bebd-4527060607be)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.0127)))
  )
  (gr_text "3. ALL COMPONENTS SHALL BE MOUNTED FLUSH TO THE BOARD, EXCEPT AS NOTED." (at 69.89 35.819999) (layer "Eco2.User") (tstamp 1d03bcd5-16be-49c4-892f-d7335ef83d58)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (thickness 0.2)))
  )
  (gr_text "5. ALL LEADS SHALL BE TRIMMED TO A MAXIMUM HEIGHT OF 2mm" (at 69.89 41.82) (layer "Eco2.User") (tstamp 26a389c4-4a09-4e73-9ac2-2ef3aae89221)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (thickness 0.2)))
  )
  (gr_text "4. FINISHED BOARD SHALL BE FREE OF ALL RESIDUES." (at 69.89 38.819998) (layer "Eco2.User") (tstamp 37a0946d-8876-42c6-8559-cef1b14776e5)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (thickness 0.2)))
  )
  (gr_text "ASSEMBLY NOTES:" (at 67.52 25.4) (layer "Eco2.User") (tstamp 393dfa37-c1e1-48da-ae19-23a88df8dc18)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.2)))
  )
  (gr_text "1. ALL COMPONENTS SHALL BE RoHS COMPLIANT." (at 69.89 29.820001) (layer "Eco2.User") (tstamp 7edf8e40-1e9e-477e-a159-be61a6e5051b)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (thickness 0.2)))
  )
  (gr_text "2. ALL UNUSED THROUGH HOLE COMPONENT LOCATIONS SHALL BE FREE OF SOLDER." (at 69.89 32.82) (layer "Eco2.User") (tstamp bc0d0119-65aa-40bc-b3d8-645195838f8a)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (thickness 0.2)))
  )
  (gr_text "B" (at 42.6339 28.9306) (layer "User.9") (tstamp 8b3af540-ab50-4130-8f36-898e5f374c69)
    (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (thickness 0.1778)))
  )

